"# SVGA sample files\r\n\r\n| File | Source file | Source | License |\r\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\r\n| `tab_home.svga` | `tab_home_select.svga` | [kongpf8848/Animation](https://github.com/kongpf8848/Animation) `app/src/main/assets/svga` | Apache License 2.0 (the repository's license) |\r\n| `tab_search.svga` | `tab_search_select.svga` | same | same |\r\n| `tab_profile.svga` | `tab_my_select.svga` | same | same |\r\n| `tab_activity.svga` | `tab_life_select.svga` | same | same |\r\n| `tab_chat.svga` | `tab_lvju_select.svga` | same | same |\r\n| `tab_list.svga` | `tab_find_house_list_select.svga` | same | same |\r\n\r\nThe files are unchanged copies, renamed after the tab they show, used by the examples of CYLTabBarController\r\n(docs/SVGA-Animation.md). They are 96 × 96 tab icons that play once (1 to 2 seconds) and keep their last frame.\r\nThe repository is published under Apache License 2.0; the icons look like they were taken from a shipping app, so\r\ntheir original author is not named there. Replace them if their origin is ever disputed.\r\n"
